{
    "slug": "apppress/file-vault",
    "name": "AppPress File Vault",
    "version": "1.1.0",
    "author": "AppPress",
    "description": "User-scoped file storage with per-user quotas, disk-backed uploads, signed download URLs, folder organization, and usage tracking. Implements StandardContracts::FILE_VAULT so App Packs, forms, and workflows can store private documents without coupling to this plugin. Ships a dual-mounted (Studio + App) admin dashboard with upload, search/filter (including folder), bulk delete, and a quota bar; a member-facing My Files page for self-service upload/download/delete/share; an embeddable member block; inline image/PDF previews on both surfaces; a member dashboard panel; mobile ListScreen and interactive DetailScreen; workflow triggers/actions; and outbound webhooks.",
